                                                "sense_id": "b3df3d04-f89c-3f80-8487-e994d98b3047",
                                                "text": "a pessimistic estimate"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5acccb6b-1d2f-469a-966d-663644fde6e6",
                                                "sense_id": "b3df3d04-f89c-3f80-8487-e994d98b3047",
                                                "text": "However pessimistic their predictions, most scientists and scholars who warn of impending disaster are really acting from antidystopian motives."
